<gpx version="1.1" creator="Claude Bruce Trail planner" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
<metadata><name>Day 43 (stop 1 of 2) - Walker Aggregates, Field &amp; Forest, Franks Lime Kiln</name></metadata>
<wpt lat="44.388871" lon="-80.236727"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>Enter parking lot from County Rd 91 on the north side, 850 m west of Concession 10. Free</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.398150" lon="-80.245730"><name>P2 alternative parking</name><desc>Summer parking only at the top of the hill on the north side where the main Trail crosses…. Free. Joins the route near km 2.3 (1180 m walk).</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.386064" lon="-80.239157"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Turn left onto the white-blazed main Bruce Trail, heading south-east. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your right.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.389416" lon="-80.234192"><name>J2</name><desc>J2: Continue straight onto the blue-blazed Franks Lime Kiln Side Trail, heading north-east. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your left; the blue-blazed Walker Aggregates Side Trail goes off on your left.) This is a short excursion (about 350 m in all): walk the whole Franks Lime Kiln Side Trail, including the short loop or branch near its end (see the map), and come back to this junction.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.389249" lon="-80.234910"><name>J3</name><desc>J3: Turn right onto the blue-blazed Field &amp; Forest Side Trail, heading north-west. (the blue-blazed Walker Aggregates Side Trail goes off ahead.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="44.394581" lon="-80.236573"><name>J4</name><desc>J4: Turnaround point. The side trail meets the white-blazed main Bruce Trail here. Turn around and retrace your steps.</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
